  "question": {
    "text": "A boy throws a ball at an angle <math><mi>θ</mi></math> with the vertical. If the vertical component of the initial velocity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the wind imparts a horizontal acceleration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> to the left, the angle at which the ball must be thrown so that the ball returns to the boy's hand is <math><mi>θ</mi></math>. What is the value of <math><mn>10</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Taking the upward vertical as positive y-direction<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br />Taking the right-side horizontal as positive&nbsp;x-direction<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mn>10</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>8</mn></math>",
